@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber
participant User
participant DatabaseSystem

User->>DatabaseSystem: Select Database
activate DatabaseSystem

User->>DatabaseSystem: Choose Append-Only Strategy Implementation
User->>DatabaseSystem: Configure Append-Only Settings

DatabaseSystem->>DatabaseSystem: Validate Append-Only Configuration

alt Configuration Valid
    DatabaseSystem->>DatabaseSystem: Enable Append-Only Mode
    DatabaseSystem->>User: Success Message
else
    DatabaseSystem->>User: Error Message
end

deactivate DatabaseSystem
@enduml